details:
(a) whether an average of 13 Government schools are being closed every day according to the latest UDISE+ Report, the details thereof, State-wise;
(b) whether the number of students enrolling in Government schools has been continuously declining as compared to the previous years; and
(c) if so, the steps being taken by Government to address the above all problems?

(a) the number of people targeted to be registered under Ayushman Bharat Pradhan Mantri Jan Aarogya Yojana (AB-PMJAY);
(b) the number of people registered under the said scheme till date, State-wise; and
(c) the number of cardholders benefited under the said scheme till date and the details thereof, State-wise?

(a) whether Programme Implementation Committee has been constituted in various districts across the country;
(b) whether guidelines have been laid down by the department for conducting regular meetings of these committees constituted at the district level, if so, the details thereof; 
(c) whether the meetings have not been held in many districts of the country as per the prescribed guidelines; and
(d) the steps being taken by Government for conducting regular meetings of the district-level Programme Implementation Committee?

(a) whether certain standards have been prescribed by DGCA from the perspective of airport security;
(b) if so, the details thereof;
(c) whether many airports across the country including Patna do not meet the prescribed security standards; and
(d) if so, the steps being taken by Government to make air travel completely safe?

(a) whether any in-principle consent has been given by Government to convert the road from Obra (near NH- 139) to Bel- Pauthu- Kurma- Dihuri- Malhad- Dobhal- Babuna Mod (near NH- 33) in the State of Bihar into National Highway;
(b) if so, the details thereof; and
(c) the status of the progress in the implementation of the said scheme?

(a) whether the Food Safety and Standards Authority of India (FSSAI) has laid down any rules regarding the labelling of expiry dates on everyday food items and other products;
(b) if so, the details thereof;
(c) whether the said rules are being blatantly violated by various companies; and
(d) the details of actions being taken against such companies?
J

(a) whether sanction has been granted for the preparation of the DPR (Detailed Project Report) for the construction of a new railway line from Bihta (near Patna) to Aurangabad; 
(b) if so, the details thereof; 
(c) the amount of funds earmarked in the present budget for the construction of the said railway line; and
(d) the timeline for the commencement and completion of the construction work of the said railway line?

(a) whether a large number of children in Bihar and other States of the country are becoming stunted and emaciated due to malnutrition despite continuous efforts by the Central Government;
(b) if so, the State-wise details thereof; and
(c) the steps taken by Government to address this issue?

(a) whether the Nai Udaan Scheme is being implemented to support candidates from the minority communities; 
(b) if so, the details thereof; and 
(c) the number of candidates who have benefitted under the said scheme during the last three years, the details thereof, year-wise and State-wise?

(a) whether the National Capital Territory of Delhi is highly vulnerable to earthquakes due to its location in a tectonically active zone; 
(b) whether the unregulated and extensive construction activities in Delhi are exacerbating the risk of seismic events; and
(c) if so, the steps being taken by Government in view of the increasing threats of earthquakes?

(a) whether according to a survey, the ratio of the elderly population above 60 years of age in the country will increase from 10.1% in 2021 to 15% in 2036 and 20.8% by 2050;
(b) whether a rapid increase in the number of elderly people and a decrease in the population below the age of 15 have been registered since 2010; and
(c) if so, the problems that would arise due to said situation and the steps being taken to address them?

(a) the total number of proposals received for the establishment of AYUSH dispensaries and integrated AYUSH hospitals from Bihar and other States across the country under the National AYUSH Mission (NAM) over the past three years, the details thereof, State-wise; 
(b) the actions taken on the said proposals; and 
(c) the steps taken to encourage those States that have not shown much interest in NAM so far?

(a) whether the Oil and Natural Gas Corporation (ONGC) is planning to undertake drilling wells for oil and gas in the State of Bihar;
(b) if so, the details thereof; and 
(c) the progress of the aforementioned plan?

(a) whether youth hostels have been built in major cities across various States of the country;
(b) if so, the details along with names of the cities, State-wise;
(c) the criteria fixed for selecting sites for the construction of youth hostels; and 
(d) the number of places where the construction of youth hostels is going on along with the total number of new hostels proposed, the details thereof, State-wise?

(a) whether a special law was enacted in 2013 to prevent sexual harassment of women at workplace;
(b) if so, the details thereof;
(c) the action taken under various provisions of the said Act so far; and
(d) the progress made towards the prevention of sexual harassment since the enactment of the said Act?

(a) whether, according to a survey, the number of elderly people aged above 60 years in the total population in the country will increase from 10.1 per cent in 2021 to 15 per cent in 2036 and 20.8 per cent by 2050;
(b) whether there is a rapid increase in the number of older people and a decrease in the population aged below 15 years; and
(c) if so, the problem arising due to the said situation and the steps being taken to deal with it?

(a) whether the names of several airports, built across the country, are associated with the names of any great personalities or famous individuals;
(b) if so, the process for associating the name of great personalities or famous individuals with the airport; and
(c) whether there is any proposal under consideration or approved to associate the names of any great personalities or famous individuals with the airports that are currently under construction or approved for construction, the details thereof?

(a) whether the number of aquatic organisms is declining day-by-day due to water pollution in many major rivers of the country including Ganga and Sone;
(b) if so, the details thereof, State-wise and river-wise; and
(c) the details of the steps taken by Government to deal with the said problem?

(a) whether Agriculture Infrastructure Fund Scheme (AIF) is being run by Government;
(b) if so, the details thereof; and
(c) the number of warehouses and cold storages constructed so far under the said scheme, the details thereof, State-wise?

(a) whether 'Swadesh Darshan' Scheme is being implemented to promote tourism in the country;
(b) the budgetary provision made and the amount spent for the said scheme in the last three years, the year-wise and State-wise details thereof; and
(c) the details of achievements of the said scheme in the last three years?

(a) whether the PM Surya Ghar Muft Bijli Yojana (PMSGMBY) has been launched by Government to provide electricity at cheap rate across the country;
(b) if so, the details thereof; and
(c) the number of houses currently targeted to be benefited under the said scheme and the achievements made so far, State-wise?
